<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Protect your busbar quickly and selectively" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Protect your busbar quickly and selectively</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>The SIPROTEC 7SS85 applies phase-selective measurement, disconnector-independent check zones and rapid tripping to minimize system damage and maintain network stability.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Adapt to your operational needs" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Adapt to your operational needs</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Configure all functions with DIGSI 5 and select bay units that match your hardware and protection requirements. Optional redundant communication improves system reliability.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Integrate with confidence" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Integrate with confidence</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Full IEC 61850 interoperability and process bus support allow seamless integration with existing SIPROTEC 5 devices, merging units and multivendor systems.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='7oz0UoVIemDRRSTXuuTBfX' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='7oz0UoVIemDRRSTXuuTBfX'><is-land on:visible>